The '''Tracking Spell''' is a particular spell normally used by the [[Pointed Hat Witches]] to mark and track magical items.

==Description==
Nothing is know about the signs and sigils that make the Tracking spell up. More spells with the same signs and sigils are needed to speculate an effect for them.

==Usage==
The [[Pointed Hat Witches]] use this tracking spell on items that are given or sold to [[Outsiders]] so the [[Knights Moralis]] can locate those items that are sold in the black market, since most magical items are very expensive. [[Luluci]] explains this when she goes visit [[Custas]] at [[Kalhn Medical Facility]] and he is no longer there.{{Ref|m|46|3}}

